{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1708902,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Imperium - The Strategy Case Study Competition","festival_id":480761,"organization_id":587,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-06-30T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-01T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/imperium-the-strategy-case-study-competition-iim-indore-1708902","region":"offline","details":"<div class=\"blue_un-border-before comp-detail un_editor_text_live expanded\">\n<p><strong>About the Event:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>In ancient Rome, imperium signified supreme power. Whether with a consul or an emperor, wielding imperium needed the ability to formulate cutthroat strategy, and the ability to execute it flawlessly. As modern corporations begin to parallel the power held by empires of old, take on the role of a business executive in this exciting strategy case competition!&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>The strategy you formulate can make or break your company&rsquo;s future. Do you think you have what it takes to exercise that influence? Compete against teams from around the globe for a chance to showcase your business and strategy acumen. Imperium,&nbsp;<strong>IIM Indore&rsquo;s international strategy case competition<\/strong>, challenges you to step into those powerful shoes. Whether navigating mergers and acquisitions, managing corporate rivalries, or identifying bold new growth avenues, this competition will test your ability to formulate and execute game-changing strategies.<\/p>\n<p><strong>The goal is singular: expand your corporate empire. Imperium awaits your rise.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Why You Should Participate:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tackle complex business problems that require sharp strategic thinking<\/li>\n<li>Build and showcase your expertise in competitive strategy, M&amp;A, and corporate growth<\/li>\n<li>Experience high-stakes decision-making in a simulated corporate battleground<\/li>\n<li>Compete with top talent from across the country<\/li>\n<li>Battle for glory at IIM Indore<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Undergraduate college students from all across India are eligible<\/li>\n<li>Cross-college participation is allowed<\/li>\n<li>Multiple teams from the same college are allowed to participate<\/li>\n<li>The final round will be conducted at the IIM Indore campus<\/li>\n<li>Participants must adhere to all event rules and guidelines<\/li>\n<li>The team will reach out to the participants with detailed rules post-registration<\/li>\n<li><strong>The competition is exclusively for Undergraduate Students<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Note:&nbsp;<\/strong>Candidates shortlisted for the offline rounds are required to confirm their participation by registering through the link that will be shared via email by participation_atharvranbhoomi@iimidr.ac.in. Failure to register through the said link will result in your entry not being counted for Atharv Ranbhoomi 2026. Further details will be intimated via the same channel for the shortlisted teams.<\/p>\n<\/div>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":null,"registration_clicks":0,"user_id":5399614,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-06-30T13:48:33+05:30","updated_at":"2026-08-21T12:47:55+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"case_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"QWC2xwi","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":1150,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":n